                    <p>
                        Thank you for your interest in volunteering with the Western Australia Kannada Sangha (WAKS)..
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        By registering as a volunteer, you acknowledge that volunteering is voluntary and unpaid. You agree to act respectfully, follow WAKS policies and safety guidelines, and support our values and community. If you are unable to attend a volunteer activity you have accepted, please let us know as early as possible.
