                    <p>
                        Some volunteer roles may require a valid Working with Children Check. WAKS may also take photos or videos during events for use in our website, newsletters, social media, and promotional materials.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        The personal information you provide will be used only for volunteer management and WAKS communications and will be handled in accordance with Australian privacy laws. Volunteers may be covered by WAKS insurance while undertaking authorised volunteer activities, subject to the terms of the policy.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        WAKS reserves the right to assign, change, or discontinue volunteer roles where necessary to ensure the safe and effective operation of our programs.
                    </p>
                    <div class="form-check" style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding-left:0; position: relative;
            left: -30px;">
